# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [ ] Firewall             Partial ssh allowlist$
$
# ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [+] Status               Active$
  [+] Incoming policy      Deny$
  [+] At boot              Yes$
$
# SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] [::]:22              Some sources$
  [ ] 0.0.0.0:22           Some sources$
$
# Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] 22/tcp from 192.0.2.0/24$
      Allow$
  [+] 22/tcp from 2001:db8::/32$
      Allow$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Disable firewall     Stop ufw (not recommended)$
   2) Application Profiles Add, remove, apply$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]: 0$
